lagotto-ts is a browser-native reimplementation of the EC2 capacity-watching
model of the spore.host `lagotto` tool (https://github.com/spore-host/lagotto).
It watches for instance-type capacity and reports matches; the pure matching
core is offline, and live capacity checks run through the truffle-ts live
finder (Node-only, behind the "./live" subpath).
